Healthcare IT solutions comprise a diverse ecosystem of digital tools that enable providers, payers, and patients to capture, store, exchange, and analyze health information electronically. Core components include electronic health record (EHR) systems, telehealth platforms, health information exchanges (HIE), practice management software, revenue cycle management tools, advanced analytics engines, and integrated clinical decision support modules.
